    <item>
      <title>Setup PostgreSQL in Ubuntu</title>
      <link>https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/setup-postgresql-in-ubuntu/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/setup-postgresql-in-ubuntu/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.postgresql.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/a&gt; is a powerful, open source object-relational database system.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;install-postgresql&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Install PostgreSQL&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#install-postgresql&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;1-from-ppa-recommended&#34;&gt;&#xA;  1. From PPA (Recommended)&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#1-from-ppa-recommended&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Create a file &lt;code&gt;/etc/apt/sources.list.d/pgdg.list&lt;/code&gt;, and add following line for the repository&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#282a36;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#6272a4&#34;&gt;# for ubuntu 16.04 users&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;deb http://apt.postgresql.org/pub/repos/apt/ xenial-pgdg main&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#6272a4&#34;&gt;# for ubuntu 15.10 users&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;deb http://apt.postgresql.org/pub/repos/apt/ wily-pgdg main&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#6272a4&#34;&gt;# for ubuntu 14.04 users&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;deb http://apt.postgresql.org/pub/repos/apt/ trusty-pgdg main&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#6272a4&#34;&gt;# for ubuntu 12.04 users&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;deb http://apt.postgresql.org/pub/repos/apt/ precise-pgdg main&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Import the repository signing key, and update the package lists&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Install node and npm</title>
      <link>https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/install-node-and-npm/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 12 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/install-node-and-npm/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://nodejs.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Node.js&lt;/a&gt; is a JavaScript runtime built on Chrome&amp;rsquo;s V8 JavaScript engine. &lt;a href=&#34;https://nodejs.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Node.js&lt;/a&gt; uses an event-driven, non-blocking I/O model that makes it lightweight and efficient. &lt;a href=&#34;https://nodejs.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Node.js&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo;s package ecosystem, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.npmjs.com/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;NPM&lt;/a&gt;, is the largest ecosystem of open source libraries in the world.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.npmjs.com/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;NPM&lt;/a&gt; is a package manager for JavaScript. Use &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.npmjs.com/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;NPM&lt;/a&gt; to install, share, and distribute code; manage dependencies in your projects; and share &amp;amp; receive feedback with others.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;install-node&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Install node&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#install-node&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;for-windows-and-mac-users&#34;&gt;&#xA;  For Windows and Mac users&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#for-windows-and-mac-users&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The installer can be downloaded from &lt;a href=&#34;https://nodejs.org/en/download/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Getting started with gulp</title>
      <link>https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/getting-started-with-gulp/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/getting-started-with-gulp/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://gulpjs.com/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Gulp&lt;/a&gt; is an automated tool that helps to enhance workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;why-gulp&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Why gulp?&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#why-gulp&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Simple&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Automation of tasks&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Platform independent&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Plugins available in large number&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;getting-started&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Getting started&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#getting-started&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;installation-instructions&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Installation Instructions&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#installation-instructions&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://npmjs.com/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;NPM&lt;/a&gt; needs to be installed in order to install &lt;a href=&#34;http://gulpjs.com/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;gulp&lt;/a&gt;. Please find the installation instructions &lt;a href=&#34;https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/install-node-and-npm/&#34; &gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Remove gulp (if installed before)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Setup XDebug in PhpStorm</title>
      <link>https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/setup-xdebug-in-phpstorm/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/setup-xdebug-in-phpstorm/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.jetbrains.com/phpstorm/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;PhpStorm&lt;/a&gt; is one of the good IDE for PHP application development available in current era. &lt;a href=&#34;https://xdebug.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;PHP Xdebug&lt;/a&gt; is a very strong tool for debugging, making the life easier for &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.php.net/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;PHP&lt;/a&gt; developers to find out the logical mistakes.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Integration of Xdebug into &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.jetbrains.com/phpstorm/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;PhpStorm&lt;/a&gt; will ease the trouble of debugging for &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.php.net/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;PHP&lt;/a&gt; developers. You can easily setup &lt;a href=&#34;https://xdebug.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Xdebug&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.jetbrains.com/phpstorm/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;PhpStorm&lt;/a&gt; by following these steps.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Requirements&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#requirements&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.jetbrains.com/phpstorm/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;PhpStorm&lt;/a&gt; (get it from &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.jetbrains.com/phpstorm/download/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://xdebug.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Xdebug&lt;/a&gt; (get it from &lt;a href=&#34;https://xdebug.org/download.php&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;procedures&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Procedures&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#procedures&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Setup &lt;a href=&#34;https://xdebug.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Xdebug&lt;/a&gt; (if you haven&amp;rsquo;t done already). Find the steps &lt;a href=&#34;https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/setup-xdebug-in-ubuntu&#34; &gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&#xA;You should be able to see &lt;a href=&#34;https://xdebug.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Xdebug&lt;/a&gt; while checking the php version.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Setup XDebug in Ubuntu</title>
      <link>https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/setup-xdebug-in-ubuntu/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 May 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://sanjeevkpandit.github.io/posts/setup-xdebug-in-ubuntu/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://xdebug.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Xdebug&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo;s basic functions include the display of stack traces on error conditions, maximum nesting level protection and time tracking.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://xdebug.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Xdebug&lt;/a&gt; is a very powerful tool for finding out the errors and testing the implementation of logics using PHP. You can easily install &lt;a href=&#34;https://xdebug.org/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Xdebug&lt;/a&gt; in your machine by following these instructions.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Always run &lt;code&gt;sudo apt-get update&lt;/code&gt; before installing any application.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;There are two sources for installation.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ubuntu&lt;/strong&gt;: This will provide you the application compiled during the building of the OS you are using. Thus, you may get older version of the application and might not get updates frequently.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PPA&lt;/strong&gt;: You will get the latest version of the application and frequent updates on the application.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;[Optional] Add PPA to your Softwares List. Skip to step #4 if you don&amp;rsquo;t want to use PPA for installation. But, I recommend to use PPA for frequent updates.&#xA;Enter these commands in your terminal.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
